abstract: >
  An Agent Skill that lets AI assistants work with Overleaf projects: pull and push
  files, compile PDFs, download .bbl files for arXiv submission and sync bidirectionally
  with conflict detection. Wraps the olcli command-line interface.
keywords:
  - Overleaf
  - LaTeX
